config PCIE_FUNC_RKEP
	tristate "Rockchip PCIe Endpoint function driver (rkep)"
	depends on PCI
	help
	  Host-side driver for the Rockchip PCIe Endpoint (RKEP) function.
	  It communicates with a Rockchip EP device such as the RK182x
	  accelerator card using DMA and interrupts, and creates a
	  /dev/pcie-rkep-<BDF> misc device for user space.
